cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "How Should a Hosted Planner Help a Small Local Agent? Preregistered Held-Out Evidence on Handoff Depth and Help Channels"
authors:
  - family-names: "Nguyen"
    given-names: "Nhu Hieu"
    affiliation: "Queensland University of Technology"
license: Apache-2.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/hieunguyen7337/sidekick-planner-handoff"
abstract: "Sidekick investigates collaboration between a hosted frontier planner and a smaller local executor agent. We evaluate the impact of handoff depth and communication channels on agent efficiency and frontier compute displacement across interactive coding and tool-use benchmarks."
keywords:
  - "agent handoff"
  - "tool use"
  - "planner-executor collaboration"
  - "AppWorld"
  - "Berkeley Function Calling Leaderboard"
